# llama.cpp GGUF model manifest (rendered by chezmoi).
#
# Format (pipe-delimited, one model per line):
#   <hf-repo-id>|<hf-file>
#   <hf-repo-id>|<hf-file>|<dest-basename>
#
# - hf-repo-id: Hugging Face repo id containing GGUF weights.
# - hf-file: GGUF filename in that repo.
# - dest-basename: optional on-disk name under ~/.llama.cpp/models/.
#   Required when two Hugging Face files share a name (mmproj-F16.gguf).
#
# Lines starting with `#` and blank lines are ignored.
#
# Downloads are opt-in via the `downloadLlamaCppModels` data variable in
# ~/.config/chezmoi/chezmoi.toml. Re-prompt by clearing that value.
#
# Companion files (mmproj, dflash) are extra manifest lines. They are not
# router ids; models.ini references them from the matching preset.

# NVIDIA Nemotron 3.5 Lightning 30B-A3B Unsloth Dynamic Q4_K_XL (~25.5 GB).
# Thinking sampling: temp 0.6, top_p 0.95, min_p 0.01.
# In-model NextN MTP via spec-type=draft-mtp in models.ini (no extra draft GGUF).
# DFlash/DSpark companion GGUFs are NVIDIA NVFP4, not Metal; do not add those files.
# https://huggingface.co/unsloth/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Lightning-30B-A3B-GGUF
unsloth/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Lightning-30B-A3B-GGUF|NVIDIA-Nemotron-3.5-Lightning-30B-A3B-UD-Q4_K_XL.gguf

# Unsloth Qwen3.5-9B Dynamic Q4_K_XL (~6.0 GB) plus F16 mmproj companion.
# Dest-rename mmproj so a generic Hugging Face mmproj-F16.gguf name stays unique on disk.
# Small-series thinking is off by default; models.ini forces reasoning=on.
# https://huggingface.co/unsloth/Qwen3.5-9B-GGUF
unsloth/Qwen3.5-9B-GGUF|Qwen3.5-9B-UD-Q4_K_XL.gguf
unsloth/Qwen3.5-9B-GGUF|mmproj-F16.gguf|Qwen3.5-9B-mmproj-F16.gguf

# Unsloth Qwen3.8-27B Dynamic Q4_K_XL (~17.6 GB) plus F16 mmproj companion.
# Hybrid thinking model, thinking on by default at reasoning_effort=xhigh; models.ini carries the
# unsloth thinking-mode sampling (temp 1.0, top_p 0.95, top_k 20, min_p 0.0).
# An external MTP draft exists upstream (MTP/mtp-Qwen3.8-27B-Q4_0.gguf); not added — llama.cpp
# external-MTP support for it is unverified, unlike Nemotron's in-model draft-mtp.
# https://huggingface.co/unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF
unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF|Qwen3.8-27B-UD-Q4_K_XL.gguf
unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF|mmproj-F16.gguf|Qwen3.8-27B-mmproj-F16.gguf
